1. Create index.html
Copy the following code into a file named index.html.


<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <!-- Page information -->
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <!-- Website title -->
    <title>My First Webpage</title>
</head>

<body>

    <!-- Main heading -->
    <h1>Welcome to My First Webpage</h1>

    <!-- First section -->
    <h2>About Me</h2>
    <p>Hello! Welcome to my first HTML webpage. I am learning web development.</p>

    <!-- Second section -->
    <h2>My Hobbies</h2>
    <p>I enjoy learning new things, listening to music, and exploring technology.</p>

    <!-- Third section -->
    <h2>My Goals</h2>
    <p>My goal is to learn HTML, CSS, and JavaScript to become a web developer.</p>

</body>

</html>
